# Creative direction

Alta General Contracting is an Edmonton contractor (landscaping, snow, general contracting), established 1999. The fit is Modern & Interactive: real job photos, a clear quote path, and restrained motion. A Luxury & Cinematic treatment is the alternative only if new original photography can carry full-bleed stories.

Use the company's photographs, logo, and published words. Do not present stock scenes as their work, invent reviews or star ratings, or copy another firm's site.

Each section needs a job: proof, a service, a quote, or a factual answer. Skip decorative gradients, generic icon cards, and repeated hero-left/photo-right layouts.
